  <h2>2. How to Input and Use the Figma File in the App</h2>

  <h3>Method A: Direct Figma Desktop &amp; Web App Access</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>Open your Figma Desktop App or visit <a href="https://www.figma.com/design/tALeKIsKPsBhH6BHzcRgVL">https://www.figma.com/design/tALeKIsKPsBhH6BHzcRgVL</a>.</li>
    <li>Use your edit access to design UI screens, mobile responsive views (390×844), and desktop views (1280×800).</li>
  </ol>

  <h3>Method B: Figma Code Connect (Mapping Code to Design)</h3>
  <p>Code Connect bridges React components directly with Figma canvas components:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Copy component Node IDs from the Figma file URL (e.g., <code>node-id=1:2</code>).</li>
    <li>Map codebase components using Figma MCP tools or <code>.figma.ts</code> files.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Method C: Push Live App Screens into Figma (Code-to-Design)</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Run the local development server: <code>npm run dev</code> (runs on <code>http://localhost:5173</code>).</li>
    <li>Use the Figma plugin to capture pixel-perfect layout frames into your design canvas.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Project Architecture &amp; Key Entry Points</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>3D Farm Game (মাঠের মানুষ):</strong> <code>src/pages/public/FarmGame.jsx</code>, <code>src/game/three/world.js</code>, <code>stage.js</code></li>
    <li><strong>Farmer Decision Suite:</strong> <code>src/pages/farmer/Plan.jsx</code>, <code>Today.jsx</code>, <code>FieldFuture.jsx</code></li>
    <li><strong>Agriculture Officer Hub:</strong> <code>src/pages/officer/Requests.jsx</code>, <code>UpazilaSupply.jsx</code>, <code>AreaMap.jsx</code></li>
    <li><strong>Chakra AI Assistant (চক্র এজেন্ট):</strong> <code>src/components/chakra/ChakraAgent.jsx</code>, <code>src/engine/chakra.js</code></li>
    <li><strong>NASA Data Harmonization Pipeline:</strong> <code>src/engine/provenance.js</code>, <code>src/data/climate/</code>, <code>src/data/soil/</code></li>
